  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3c14c02c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Filtering Invalid and Non-Meaningful Ride Durations\n",
    "\n",
    "Ride duration analysis identified:\n",
    "- 29 rides with negative durations\n",
    "- 155,632 rides shorter than one minute\n",
    "- 99th percentile = ~89 minutes \n",
    "- max = 1574 minutes\n",
    "\n",
    "Negative durations were treated as invalid records caused by timestamp inconsistencies.\n",
    "\n",
    "Ultra-short rides (<1 minute) were non-meaningful associated with casual riders and almost exclusively linked to electric bikes. These rides likely represent failed unlock attempts, docking issues, exploratory usage, or aborted sessions rather than meaningful rider behavior.\n",
    "\n",
    "These observations were excluded to improve analytical reliability and ensure trip metrics reflected meaningful rider activity.\n",
    "\n",
    "Long-duration rides were investigated separately and retained in the analytical dataset because they appeared strongly associated with casual rider leisure behavior rather than data quality errors."
   ]
  },
